      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Still struggling with OSC issues, 100 days later..!\nNetworking bugs are the most difficult things to debug, and when networking randomly fails, it makes world creation so much more difficult. I'm honestly not sure if I'd want to make a brand-new VRChat world at this point. It could potentially just... stop working, couldn't it?\nPlease give us an update on when we can expect these issues to be fixed😢 So far we haven't heard anything...",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
